  {"dato": "Los Humanoides se presenta como una banda de cuatro miembros que corresponden a los cuatro colores CMYK.", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/loshumanoides", "cita": "The band comprises four colors: C (cee) on programming and vocoder, M (em) on bass and vocoder, Y (why?) on synthesizers and vocoder and K (kay) on guitars and vocoder"},
